{"steam_appid":1534850,"steam_name":"Floor Plan 2 VR","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1534850/358280/4ccf02811d12c198086579f4971fb42e0f230db8/1750999942/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743488757","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256828407/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1743488757","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/ss_253e0b64239eebe1c720033651395ef305f6924d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785174853","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/ss_7f574e6f46a44b8f0a0a0dbfdaceb9e28d55f976.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785174853","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/ss_283ca177544cb183beee78f4d23b23f36f1d0d20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785174853","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/ss_5d7f7316dd6d59e5fa57740a71f41dfc14a90220.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785174853","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/ss_cfc5348a82fe1efbea20469c50b1ac181485f17b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785174853"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Nominated for multiple VR Game of the Year awards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floor Plan 2</strong> is a comedy adventure inspired by escape rooms, packed with more puzzles than you can fit in an elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first day of work, the boss sends you to find a lost treasure that will turn the company's fortunes around. And good news: it's somewhere in the building! Just use the elevator down the hall. By the way, each floor is a gateway to another world, nobody speaks your language, and time and space are fluid. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.poster.avif?t=1785174853\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.webm?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.mp4?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HILARIOUS, MIND-BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your elevator to explore a series of interconnected escape rooms. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, and unravel their secrets. Revisit completed floors to find new, remixed challenges waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.poster.avif?t=1785174853\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.webm?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.mp4?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAND PRESENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Red Harrys, lost critters hidden throughout the building, to earn hand presents and transform your hands in all sorts of unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.poster.avif?t=1785174853\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.webm?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.mp4?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6+ HOURS OF HANDCRAFTED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with critically-acclaimed puzzles and memorable &quot;aha!&quot; moments that respect your time and intelligence. Now includes the Backside Story expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.poster.avif?t=1785174853\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.webm?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.mp4?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARMING-AS-HECK WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for VR, comfortable for everyone, and developed with love by the small but mighty Turbo Button team.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Compatible VR headset required.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Turbo Button"],"publishers":["Turbo Button"],"release_date":"Apr 